Description: Experimental DuoBar circular battery, Wi-Fi and cellular indicator for iOS 26.
 Standard Dopamine Rootless on iOS 26.0-26.0.1 only. Real-device tests pending.
 Safe runtime guards leave native status icons intact if required private APIs are unavailable.
